==Strategy==
This stage is basically an [[Moon (Into the Future)|Into The Future Chapter 1 Moon]] remake, and is balanced around having all of the [[Anti-unstarred Alien Treasures]]. With this in mind, the stage isn't too hard.

Use any [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|Anti-Alien cats]] you have, such as [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Seafarer Cat]], [[Rover Cat (Rare Cat)|Catellite]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cat]], as well as your usual attackers such as [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]]. It's going to be a slow chipping battle, but none of the enemies individually pose a big threat.

